 "note": "p16 from cd40109b (scanned Harris data) p.4 terminal assignment: 1 VCC, 2 ENABLE A, 3 A, 4 E, 5 F, 6 B, 7 ENABLE B, 8 VSS, 9 ENABLE C, 10 C, 11 G, 12 NC, 13 H, 14 D, 15 ENABLE D, 16 VDD; ENABLE A-D shortened to ENA-END. Logic diagram p.1: A (pin 3) -> E (pin 4), enable A on pin 2, both inputs through VCC-side level shifters, output on VDD. Truth table p.1 (cd40109b-q1 p.2): ENABLE 1 -> output = input, ENABLE 0 -> Z. Inputs and enables are in the VCC (low) domain, E-H in the VDD (high) domain. VCC may exceed VDD (then it shifts high to low).",
